<% content_for :title, "Refund & Cancellation Policy — TrustShip" %>

<div class="print:bg-white">
  <p class="mb-6">
    <%= link_to "← Back to home", root_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %>
  </p>

  <header class="border-b border-gray-200 pb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Last updated: May 2026</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 text-sm print:hidden" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">On this page</p>
    <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-gray-700">
      <li><a href="#refund-1" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">TrustShip platform fees</a></li>
      <li><a href="#refund-2" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Order cancellation</a></li>
      <li><a href="#refund-3" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">RTO orders</a></li>
      <li><a href="#refund-4" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Prepaid orders (buyer payments)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#refund-5" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">How to request a refund</a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
    <section id="refund-1">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">1. TrustShip platform fees</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>TrustShip per-shipment fees are charged when you ship; rates depend on weight tier and COD vs UPI payment (from ₹<%= Order::WEIGHT_TIERS[500][:prepaid] %> / ₹<%= Order::WEIGHT_TIERS[500][:cod] %> on the smallest tier—see your Orders dashboard for the full table)</li>
        <li>Fees are non-refundable once the shipment is created</li>
        <li>If shipment creation fails due to our error, the fee is refunded within 7 business days</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="refund-2">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">2. Order cancellation</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Orders can be cancelled before <strong class="text-gray-800">Ship Now</strong> is used</li>
        <li>Once an AWB is generated, cancellation goes through Delhivery</li>
        <li>Delhivery cancellation charges may apply</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="refund-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">3. RTO orders</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>RTO return shipping costs are not refunded by TrustShip</li>
        <li>Delhivery handles RTO billing separately</li>
        <li>The TrustShip fee is not refunded for RTO orders</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="refund-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">4. Prepaid orders (buyer payments)</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Buyer advance payments are processed via Razorpay</li>
        <li>Refunds to buyers for cancelled orders must be initiated by the seller</li>
        <li>TrustShip does not hold buyer payments</li>
        <li>Razorpay’s refund policy applies</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="refund-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">5. How to request a refund</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        Email <%= link_to support_email, "mailto:#{support_email}", class: "text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %>
        with order ID, AWB number, and reason for refund.
        Typical processing time: 5–7 business days.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
